  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Hei Fan’s true inheritance, Fang Yuan draws out a piece of almost transparent ice that seals Immortal Gu Year in its upper portion so the Gu hibernates without leaking aura, an effect like fossilization or amber. Flowing water fills more than half the space below, and the ice feels as if it seals that water more than the year Gu.",
